.TH TYPEFAST 6.SH NAMEtypefast \- a typing game of falling words.SH SYNOPSIS\fBtypefast\fR.SH DESCRIPTIONWords fall down the screen, and each must be typed, and ended with SPACEor RETURN, before it reaches the bottom.  It offers instructions\fR(\fBn\fRskips them) and asks the pace, 1, 2 or 3.  Ten words missed end thegame, and it reports your words per minute..PP\fBtypefast\fRreads TERMCAP as the terminal's description itself, not as the name of afile, so give it one first:.nf    . /dd/SYS/termcap.entry.fisets TERMCAP to the entry for your TERM in bash.  Without it the gameanswers\fBUnknown terminal type\fR.\fR.SH SEE ALSOletters, tt